# Requested authority only; the existing launch path remains in control.
# One manifest for bench-load, bench-input-load, bench-cpu, bench-heap-load,
# bench-sbrk-load, bench-burn, bench-lock-self and bench-lock-mutual. The kernel
# trace object (Trace_ABI) is for bench-cpu's summary after its run (the
# ACCOUNTING lines bench-scheduler checks); every benchmark profile that
# starts one of them approves it, (trace approve-declared).
(Executable_Manifest
  identity => "com.cubit.bench.load"
  version => "0.1.0"
  requests => [(Request.Kernel_Object (Kernel_Object_Request Kernel_Object.Trace "trace"))])
